"name": "When should I use もしもし (moshi moshi) on the phone?",
"acceptedAnswer": {
"@type": "Answer",
"text": "Use it when answering calls from friends, family, or people you’re comfortable with. Skip it on formal calls, like those with clients, service staff, or coworkers, where you’d use greetings like お世話になっております or はい、〜でございます instead.

